<title>FRANCE: Arthuis says French privatisations to go ahead.</title>
<headline>Arthuis says French privatisations to go ahead.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>French Finance Minister Jean Arthuis said on Monday that planned privatisations of state companies would go ahead if an early general election was called.</p>
<p>&quot;All that has been launched will be carried out according to schedule,&quot; he told Europe 1 radio.</p>
<p>President Jacques Chirac is widely expected to announce a dissolution of the French parliament in a televised speech on Monday night to clear the decks for France's drive to prepare for a single European currency.</p>
</text>
